# FODIP Digital 2030 - Trivy image-scan exceptions (Sprint Enterprise 0, Lot 1).
#
# Empty by design: nothing has been acknowledged-and-deferred yet, and this file exists only so
# .github/workflows/ci.yml's Trivy steps have a real file to bind-mount (a missing host path
# would make Docker create a directory there instead, breaking --ignorefile).
#
# If a CI run reports a CRITICAL/HIGH finding that genuinely cannot be fixed right now (no patched
# base image yet, upstream hasn't released a fix), add its CVE ID here on its own line with a
# comment explaining why it is deferred and what would resolve it - never to silence a finding
# that could instead be fixed by bumping a dependency or the base image.
